# Go
# These are build artifacts at the repo root. The leading slash matters: an
# unanchored pattern matches at every depth, and `vendor/` written that way
# hid internal/web/static/vendor/morphdom.js from git — the page then loaded
# index.html as JavaScript. scripts/check.sh has a "hidden sources" step that
# fails when a pattern here swallows a source file.
/bin/
/dist/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
/coverage.html
/vendor/

# Go workspace
go.work
go.work.sum

# Node / frontend
node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local data & secrets
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# 原型 zip 保留在 docs/ 中（设计输入），但禁止解压产物入库
docs/flatline-prototype-unpacked/